            Paragraph(Text("Nodal expansion derives D=X(X^2-n^2), Q=(v(-n)+v(0)+v(n))X^2+n(v(n)-v(-n))X-n^2 v(0), and P=a(v(n)-v(-n))X^2+an(v(n)+v(-n))X from the actual arithmetic symbol and its oddness.")),
